## Output Requirements

When calling `task_complete`, include a `discoveries` object with extracted credentials and hashes:

```json
{
  "summary": "Brief description",
  "discoveries": {
    "credentials": [
      {"username": "jdoe", "password": "P@ssw0rd", "domain": "contoso.local", "source": "{{ technique }}", "is_admin": false}
    ],
    "hashes": [
      {"username": "admin", "domain": "contoso.local", "hash_value": "aad3b4...:31d6cf...", "hash_type": "NTLM", "source": "{{ technique }}"}
    ],
    "discovered_users": [
      {"username": "jdoe", "domain": "contoso.local", "is_admin": false}
    ]
  }
}
```

Include ALL credentials and hashes found, even partial results.
